{"title": "Talk to the Sentient Amulet", "pageid": 4598, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet.webp/300px-Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet.webp, /w/images/a/a5/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet.webp/300px-Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Talk_to_the_Sentient_Amulet.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Talk to the Sentient Amulet</b> is an action that allows the wearer of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Rare)\">Sentient Amulet</a> to speak with the spirit trapped within. It progresses or begins the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Cursed_Monk\" title=\"Help the Cursed Monk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help the Cursed Monk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Cursed_Monk\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Help the Cursed Monk\">Help the Cursed Monk</a> quest.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Speak with the consciousness lingering inside the Sentient Amulet.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title